# CLOSE_WAIT + application close -> LAST_ACK. We close our own side.
define the potential action<define-lang.org:tcp:/transitions/close_wait_app_close> {
    it also assigns the position</states/close_wait>.
    it also assigns the position</states/last_ack>.

    define the position<run>.

    it happens when {
        the position<run> has a particle.
    } and it does {
        move the particle in position</states/close_wait> to position</states/last_ack>.
        destroy the particle in position<run>.
    }
}
